WEBVTT

01:37.940 --> 01:40.700
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.330 --> 01:43.680
[Episode 39]

01:49.229 --> 01:50.090
Lu Qianqiao...

01:52.039 --> 01:52.920
Lu Qianqiao!

02:02.000 --> 02:03.000
Lu Qianqiao!

02:12.680 --> 02:13.590
Lu Qianqiao...

02:20.560 --> 02:22.190
Lu Qianqiao!

02:34.430 --> 02:35.750
Lu Qianqiao!

02:41.360 --> 02:42.240
Lu Qianqiao,

02:42.560 --> 02:43.520
don't go!

02:43.800 --> 02:44.680
I'm Xin Mei!

02:44.680 --> 02:45.870
Come back!

02:47.400 --> 02:49.560
Lu Qianqiao!

03:02.750 --> 03:03.280
No...

03:07.040 --> 03:07.710
He forgot.

03:11.630 --> 03:12.440
No...

03:13.960 --> 03:14.910
No!

03:18.870 --> 03:20.760
No!

04:07.290 --> 04:10.890
[One year later]

04:32.230 --> 04:34.159
How did you find time to come see me?

04:34.870 --> 04:37.130
Someone asked me to pass a message to you.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.110
Go ahead.

04:38.920 --> 04:39.850
Close your eyes.

04:51.120 --> 04:51.920
Do you feel it?

04:53.800 --> 04:54.510
Feel what?

04:55.070 --> 04:55.800
The "field."

04:57.510 --> 04:58.190
"Field?"

05:00.360 --> 05:01.360
Taoism often says

05:01.830 --> 05:03.360
that all things are alive with spirit.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.430
Life exists

05:04.800 --> 05:06.360
in forms and states

05:07.240 --> 05:08.360
far beyond

05:08.360 --> 05:09.490
what we can imagine.

05:11.430 --> 05:12.270
In this world,

05:12.750 --> 05:13.880
the things we can see

05:14.070 --> 05:14.830
and touch—

05:15.560 --> 05:17.620
like flowers, birds, fish, insects,

05:18.040 --> 05:19.630
all kinds of beasts and creatures,

05:19.630 --> 05:21.040
you, and me—

05:21.630 --> 05:23.760
are actually all the same kind of life.

05:24.040 --> 05:25.100
What else is there?

05:25.600 --> 05:26.730
There are many more.

05:27.480 --> 05:28.810
The field is one of them.

05:30.190 --> 05:32.630
It is consciousness
detached from the physical body.

05:32.630 --> 05:34.630
It is the thought that can take form.

05:34.630 --> 05:36.240
It is the subtle fluctuations

05:36.240 --> 05:38.240
perceptible only in higher realms.

05:40.750 --> 05:41.880
I don't understand.

05:42.070 --> 05:44.000
What exactly are you trying to say?

05:50.000 --> 05:52.000
Sheng has transformed into a field.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.920
Xia Xuanzi killed his wives and children,

05:56.920 --> 05:58.190
committed endless atrocities,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.870
and had long since become a demon.

05:59.870 --> 06:00.680
But Sheng sacrificed herself

06:00.680 --> 06:02.240
and perished together with him.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.370
By that merit alone,

06:03.430 --> 06:05.360
she earned the right to ascend to godhood.

06:05.360 --> 06:06.620
Sheng has become a god?

06:07.560 --> 06:08.030
Yes.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.830
But unfortunately, the heavenly ladder
had long since broken.

06:10.830 --> 06:12.600
Mortal bodies of the mundane world

06:12.600 --> 06:14.000
cannot ascend to heaven.

06:14.480 --> 06:16.310
So Sheng could only ascend
by transforming herself

06:16.310 --> 06:17.040
into a field.

06:20.190 --> 06:21.240
If the Crazy Taoist's prophecy

06:21.240 --> 06:21.920
is true,

06:23.670 --> 06:25.260
that god must be me.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.220
After all, a demon god is a god,

06:30.280 --> 06:31.000
isn't it?

06:32.630 --> 06:33.240
So,

06:34.240 --> 06:35.770
Sheng is already in heaven.

06:36.190 --> 06:37.920
What divine post does she hold?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.320
She has yet to ascend.

06:45.600 --> 06:46.159
Why?

06:47.510 --> 06:49.040
She still has an obsession.

06:52.159 --> 06:54.020
After transforming into a field,

06:54.560 --> 06:56.760
she's been wandering the mortal realm.

06:57.680 --> 06:59.680
She's been wandering all this time?

07:03.270 --> 07:04.330
Where is Sheng now?

07:14.160 --> 07:16.090
Upon unreachable mountain peaks,

07:16.830 --> 07:18.760
across plains of boundless green,

07:19.510 --> 07:22.310
or in the depths of the ocean
silent for millennia.

07:22.800 --> 07:23.510
Or perhaps

07:24.630 --> 07:25.830
she has become a tree,

07:26.480 --> 07:27.160
a flower,

07:28.070 --> 07:29.000
or a speck of dust

07:29.270 --> 07:30.470
resting in your palm.

07:32.000 --> 07:33.260
A field can be anywhere

07:34.000 --> 07:35.120
and anything.

07:36.120 --> 07:36.600
A field

07:37.510 --> 07:38.370
is everywhere.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.840
She came looking for you, right?

07:47.510 --> 07:49.920
I've cultivated the Path of Detachment
to its pinnacle.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.650
All things are spiritual to me.

07:52.830 --> 07:53.750
Occasionally, I can hear

07:53.750 --> 07:54.480
her voice.

07:55.390 --> 07:56.390
It's just that...

07:57.430 --> 07:58.270
I don't know

07:58.270 --> 07:59.530
if it counts as a voice.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.390
Do you know

08:03.390 --> 08:05.720
why she still lingers in the mortal realm?

08:07.680 --> 08:08.610
She can't let go—

08:10.830 --> 08:12.030
so she lingers still.

08:14.480 --> 08:15.940
She told me you have a wish:

08:16.270 --> 08:18.420
to break the Curse of Five Deficiencies,

08:18.420 --> 08:19.100
free Lu Qianqiao

08:19.100 --> 08:20.830
from the fate of the War Demons,

08:21.190 --> 08:23.750
and allow him to live
an ordinary, peaceful life.

08:23.750 --> 08:25.950
She wants to help you fulfill that wish.

08:29.190 --> 08:30.680
But how can that be done?

08:33.030 --> 08:34.230
Go to the divine realm

08:34.630 --> 08:37.159
and lift the curse
placed upon the War Demons.

08:48.910 --> 08:49.630
This is...

08:50.790 --> 08:53.650
The path to heaven that the field
has opened for you.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.120
The only reason she's lingered here,

08:55.120 --> 08:56.520
bound by this obsession,

08:56.600 --> 08:57.080
is to

08:57.870 --> 08:59.080
open this path for you

08:59.630 --> 09:02.030
and send your primordial spirit to heaven.

09:10.200 --> 09:10.720
Go.

09:12.080 --> 09:13.750
Once your long-held wish is fulfilled,

09:13.750 --> 09:15.550
she will finally be able to let go

09:16.230 --> 09:17.830
and complete her ascension.

10:31.870 --> 10:32.600
Young Deity.

10:42.320 --> 10:42.980
Greetings,

10:43.200 --> 10:43.800
Immortal.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.760
Greetings, Young Deity.

10:46.550 --> 10:47.840
Where are you from, Immortal,

10:47.840 --> 10:49.240
and what brings you here?

10:49.870 --> 10:51.150
I come from the mortal realm below,

10:51.150 --> 10:52.790
and I would like to ask for directions.

10:52.790 --> 10:54.750
May I ask where the Deity
in charge of the archives

10:54.750 --> 10:55.480
can be found?

10:57.240 --> 10:58.570
The mortal realm below?

11:00.840 --> 11:02.030
You must mean

11:02.350 --> 11:03.300
the Penghu Immortal Abode

11:03.300 --> 11:05.430
at the foot of Fanyun Mountain, right?

11:06.360 --> 11:08.820
As for the Deity
in charge of the archives...

11:18.630 --> 11:20.480
Since the heavenly ladder broke,

11:20.480 --> 11:22.320
no new gods have ascended.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.000
So these minor matters

11:24.000 --> 11:25.330
have all been left to me.

11:28.670 --> 11:30.690
I wonder where I might find the archives

11:30.690 --> 11:32.420
concerning the War Demon clan.

11:39.840 --> 11:40.750
Anything with the words "War Demon"

11:40.750 --> 11:41.440
is here.

11:42.360 --> 11:44.890
What exactly
are you asking about, Immortal?

11:50.910 --> 11:52.110
A thousand years ago,

11:52.480 --> 11:54.320
the War Demons violated the heavenly laws

11:54.320 --> 11:56.440
and were punished with
the Curse of Five Deficiencies.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.750
Their entire clan was condemned to

11:57.750 --> 12:00.210
violent bloodlust, insensitivity to pain,

12:00.320 --> 12:02.030
sleeplessness, color blindness,

12:02.030 --> 12:04.890
and the taste of decay
in everything they consumed.

12:05.000 --> 12:06.790
The thousand-year sentence
has already passed,

12:06.790 --> 12:08.590
yet the curse upon them remains.

12:10.870 --> 12:11.440
So,

12:12.360 --> 12:14.000
could you look into

12:14.320 --> 12:15.000
why that is?

12:18.840 --> 12:19.840
A thousand years?

12:20.870 --> 12:21.670
Curse?

12:34.200 --> 12:34.750
Found it.

12:46.360 --> 12:46.840
Done.

12:47.910 --> 12:48.510
Done?

12:50.960 --> 12:53.090
Are you sure the curse has been lifted?

12:53.790 --> 12:55.270
Didn't you watch me

12:55.440 --> 12:57.550
erase it with your own eyes, Immortal?

12:57.550 --> 12:59.080
That's all it takes?

13:00.870 --> 13:01.390
Yeah.

13:03.120 --> 13:04.450
What else would it take?

13:08.150 --> 13:08.750
Immortal,

13:10.230 --> 13:11.360
is there anything else you need?

13:11.360 --> 13:11.870
I...

13:13.150 --> 13:13.720
No.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.700
You've come from afar.

13:18.390 --> 13:21.120
You can visit Zhenghua Palace
while you're here.

13:23.150 --> 13:24.030
The Gods of the Five Directions

13:24.030 --> 13:25.510
are hosting a wine tasting.

13:25.510 --> 13:27.030
If you have nothing urgent,

13:27.030 --> 13:28.890
you're welcome to drink your fill

13:29.200 --> 13:30.200
before you leave.

13:45.360 --> 13:47.090
Immortal, why are you leaving?

13:47.200 --> 13:49.000
Zhenghua Palace is not that way!

13:50.670 --> 13:51.270
Immortal!

13:52.120 --> 13:52.720
Immortal!

14:38.580 --> 14:46.940
[Xin Xie Manor]

14:51.910 --> 14:52.720
Bamboo hats!

14:53.390 --> 14:55.080
Handwoven bamboo hats!

14:56.630 --> 14:57.760
Come and take a look!

14:58.080 --> 15:00.540
Handwoven straw raincoats
and bamboo hats!

15:01.270 --> 15:02.510
Come take a look!

15:05.720 --> 15:07.550
Come on! Straw raincoats!

15:08.390 --> 15:09.320
Bamboo hats!

15:10.240 --> 15:11.390
All handwoven!

15:12.000 --> 15:12.840
Bamboo hats!

15:13.480 --> 15:14.390
Straw raincoats!

15:14.390 --> 15:15.000
Come on!

15:15.080 --> 15:16.000
Cheers!

15:16.230 --> 15:16.690
Come on!

15:20.840 --> 15:21.550
Sit, sit.

15:21.570 --> 15:22.000
Come on.

15:22.000 --> 15:23.390
The dishes today are pretty good.

15:23.390 --> 15:24.030
Eat more.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.320
Yes, yes.

15:26.150 --> 15:26.750
Come on.

15:27.360 --> 15:27.870
Here.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.480
Have some of this.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.000
Eat up.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.930
Thank you all for coming today.

15:32.030 --> 15:32.810
Come on, cheers!

15:32.810 --> 15:33.360
Cheers.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.440
Mei,

15:42.870 --> 15:44.180
don't just eat!

15:44.320 --> 15:45.530
Drink with us!

15:45.750 --> 15:47.150
It's rare for you to come back!

15:47.150 --> 15:48.880
Come on, let's toast together!

15:48.990 --> 15:49.990
Come on, cheers!

15:50.170 --> 15:50.810
Cheers!

15:50.840 --> 15:52.030
Come on, everyone together!

15:52.030 --> 15:52.480
Bottoms up!

15:52.480 --> 15:53.270
Bottoms up!

15:53.440 --> 15:54.270
Cheers!

15:54.870 --> 15:55.790
Just take a sip.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.360
Come on.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.390
Okay, okay.

16:00.910 --> 16:01.630
Thank you.

16:02.550 --> 16:03.010
Not bad!

16:15.540 --> 16:17.030
Honey water can sober you up.

16:17.030 --> 16:19.030
Drinking it will ease the headache.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.610
Why did you come out?

16:24.030 --> 16:25.960
Brother said you were in a bad mood,

16:26.120 --> 16:27.520
so we came to check on you.

16:29.790 --> 16:30.920
I'm not in a bad mood.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.980
I've just been thinking about

16:34.320 --> 16:35.270
where I should go

16:36.080 --> 16:37.360
from here.

16:38.080 --> 16:40.030
Can't... Can't you just stay?

16:40.510 --> 16:41.360
Can't you stay here

16:41.360 --> 16:42.270
with us?

16:43.200 --> 16:44.870
Aside from Foster Father and Grandpa Pang,

16:44.870 --> 16:46.600
you're the nicest person to us.

16:46.910 --> 16:47.870
Jiujiu and I both hope

16:47.870 --> 16:48.670
you can stay.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.150
But...

16:53.120 --> 16:54.670
I still need to find someone.

16:54.670 --> 16:56.120
But Grandpa Pang said

16:56.630 --> 16:58.150
you have nowhere to go.

16:58.720 --> 17:00.120
Your sect has no one left,

17:00.240 --> 17:01.900
and neither does your family.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.150
Who said I have no family?

17:05.880 --> 17:06.790
I'm married.

17:07.550 --> 17:09.079
I have to go find my husband.

17:13.069 --> 17:14.130
Isn't your husband

17:14.270 --> 17:15.720
our foster father?

17:16.510 --> 17:17.569
He's already dead.

17:20.589 --> 17:21.390
He's not dead.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.160
How is that possible?

17:24.160 --> 17:25.069
We saw with our own eyes

17:25.069 --> 17:26.240
that he was sentenced
to death by 1,000 cuts.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.640
Blades stabbed into him,

17:27.680 --> 17:28.740
blood everywhere.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.110
Didn't you even burn hell money for him

17:30.110 --> 17:31.590
together with us?

17:35.920 --> 17:37.520
That was all meant to fool us.

17:38.030 --> 17:38.960
He is a War Demon,

17:39.000 --> 17:39.860
very powerful.

17:40.270 --> 17:42.200
That execution couldn't kill him.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.640
But unfortunately,

17:45.270 --> 17:47.720
in order to sever
the Jianmu Heavenly Ladder

17:47.720 --> 17:50.050
and save all living beings from calamity,

17:50.310 --> 17:52.160
he sacrificed all his memories.

17:54.000 --> 17:56.000
That is why he hasn't come to find us.

17:57.160 --> 17:59.360
Our memories are what make us who we are.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.120
If his memories are gone,

18:02.000 --> 18:03.030
he'll become

18:03.030 --> 18:04.360
an entirely new person.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.010
But I don't think so.

18:08.680 --> 18:10.410
Even if he's lost his memories,

18:10.750 --> 18:11.440
his nature,

18:12.270 --> 18:13.110
temperament,

18:13.880 --> 18:15.280
habits, and preferences

18:16.000 --> 18:16.930
will not change.

18:18.350 --> 18:19.590
So I must find him.

18:20.400 --> 18:20.830
But...

18:21.350 --> 18:23.410
But he doesn't remember you anymore.

18:24.640 --> 18:25.310
It's okay.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.070
I remember him.

18:27.920 --> 18:28.780
When I find him,

18:29.550 --> 18:30.590
I'll definitely bring him back

18:30.590 --> 18:31.200
to see you.

18:32.000 --> 18:32.880
It's a deal!

18:34.240 --> 18:34.920
Deal.

18:46.550 --> 18:47.350
Immortal Xin!

18:49.970 --> 18:51.110
Immortal Xin, you also came back this time

18:51.110 --> 18:52.570
for the birthday banquet?

18:55.060 --> 18:56.310
The banquet isn't over yet.

18:56.310 --> 18:57.710
Are you leaving already?

18:58.750 --> 18:59.350
Yes.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.880
I still have other matters to attend to.

19:00.880 --> 19:01.940
I have to leave now.

19:02.660 --> 19:03.920
Then farewell, Immortal Xin.

19:03.920 --> 19:06.200
Come back and visit often
when you have time.

19:06.200 --> 19:07.460
I will when I have time.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.770
Please come in, you two.

19:19.480 --> 19:20.080
Take care.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.030
-Please come in.
-Take a look.

19:24.030 --> 19:25.000
These are all excellent wines.

19:25.000 --> 19:25.600
Excuse me.

19:26.720 --> 19:27.400
Take a look at this one.

19:27.400 --> 19:28.110
Ten-year-aged wine.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.310
Excuse me, coming through!

19:29.310 --> 19:30.040
And this one.

20:11.790 --> 20:13.390
Why do you keep following me?

20:28.240 --> 20:28.640
Here.

20:31.680 --> 20:33.030
It's no use acting all cute with me.

20:33.030 --> 20:34.000
I have a journey ahead of me.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.070
I only have dry food.

20:35.070 --> 20:36.330
No little fish for you.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.060
Stop following me.

21:13.350 --> 21:13.950
Landlady!

21:14.640 --> 21:15.310
Coming, coming!

21:15.310 --> 21:16.310
Look at this mess!

21:16.350 --> 21:17.480
Let me pour you another cup.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.480
I'm so sorry, sir.

21:18.550 --> 21:19.310
I'll get you

21:19.310 --> 21:20.310
a fresh one right away.

21:20.310 --> 21:20.970
Hurry it up.

21:21.880 --> 21:24.240
Didn't you say
you had experience with this?

21:24.240 --> 21:26.300
The last inn I was at had bad business.

21:26.750 --> 21:27.400
Landlady!

21:28.240 --> 21:29.110
Coming!

21:29.680 --> 21:30.510
Take it out and throw it away.

21:30.510 --> 21:32.150
You know where to dump it, right?

21:32.150 --> 21:33.480
Don't worry, Landlady.

21:33.760 --> 21:34.720
All this worrying—

21:34.720 --> 21:35.400
I feel like I've aged another 10 years.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.790
Landlady, where is my food?

21:36.790 --> 21:37.480
I've been waiting forever!

21:37.480 --> 21:37.880
Yeah.

21:38.200 --> 21:39.510
We are short-handed. Please forgive us.

21:39.510 --> 21:40.200
It'll be right out!

21:40.200 --> 21:41.850
Alright, alright, just hurry up!

21:41.850 --> 21:44.390
[Safe Haven Inn:
Your Safety is Guaranteed.

21:53.240 --> 21:53.920
Master.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.550
Master, are you okay?

21:59.000 --> 21:59.860
Are you hungry?

22:00.720 --> 22:01.750
So what if I am?

22:02.550 --> 22:03.480
Can you cook?

22:04.830 --> 22:05.640
I can't.

22:06.110 --> 22:07.310
But the Landlady can.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.930
I'll ask her to cook for you.

22:11.400 --> 22:12.800
Have you found a cook yet?

22:13.550 --> 22:14.240
No.

22:15.030 --> 22:17.000
The Landlady's standards are very high.

22:17.000 --> 22:18.720
Not only does he have to cook well,

22:18.720 --> 22:20.510
but he also needs to know martial arts
and be able to fight.

22:20.510 --> 22:21.790
He also needs to be good-looking,

22:21.790 --> 22:23.000
eloquent,

22:23.110 --> 22:24.480
and skilled at coaxing people.

22:24.480 --> 22:26.410
Then she's never going to find one.

22:26.880 --> 22:27.610
That's true.

22:28.110 --> 22:29.070
After all, people like me,

22:29.070 --> 22:29.720
who excel at everything

22:29.720 --> 22:30.510
and can do anything,

22:30.510 --> 22:31.400
are quite rare.

22:34.200 --> 22:35.510
And which of those qualities

22:35.510 --> 22:37.440
do you think you actually possess?

22:37.480 --> 22:38.830
Which one do I lack?

22:42.270 --> 22:42.930
Never mind.

22:43.070 --> 22:44.000
Get back to work.

22:54.160 --> 22:54.830
Master.

22:56.070 --> 22:56.800
I've noticed

22:57.550 --> 22:59.350
you've been out of sorts lately.

23:07.880 --> 23:08.510
Yeah.

23:09.480 --> 23:11.010
Why have I been out of sorts?

23:23.200 --> 23:23.830
Xin Mei?

23:28.790 --> 23:29.680
Mei!

23:30.200 --> 23:31.200
What a rare guest.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.810
Why are you here?

23:36.480 --> 23:37.160
Just passing by.

23:37.160 --> 23:38.240
Thought I'd drop in.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.170
Why are you here?

23:39.350 --> 23:40.680
I can't manage on my own,

23:40.720 --> 23:42.180
so I asked him to come help.

23:43.030 --> 23:44.310
Not only does she not pay me,

23:44.310 --> 23:46.640
but I also have to help
train the new staff.

23:46.680 --> 23:48.540
Landlady, you hired someone new?

23:48.960 --> 23:49.720
It's me.

23:49.750 --> 23:50.590
Mei,

23:50.830 --> 23:52.400
I'm working as an attendant here now.

23:52.400 --> 23:53.510
Master kept me here

23:53.510 --> 23:54.910
to teach me martial arts.

23:55.000 --> 23:55.660
Attendant!

23:56.270 --> 23:56.870
Landlady!

23:57.350 --> 23:58.000
Coming!

23:58.350 --> 23:59.550
Hurry up and sit inside.

23:59.550 --> 24:00.790
I'll cook some nice dishes later,

24:00.790 --> 24:02.410
and we'll have a proper drink together!

24:02.410 --> 24:02.880
Okay.

24:03.270 --> 24:04.270
Come on, let's go.

24:05.510 --> 24:06.440
Coming, coming!

24:15.110 --> 24:16.370
Your business is good.

24:17.200 --> 24:18.330
The inn has changed.

24:18.790 --> 24:19.480
Changed?

24:20.000 --> 24:20.480
Yeah.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.000
The times have changed.

24:22.000 --> 24:24.160
A new emperor has ascended,
placing great importance on craftsmanship.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.680
Schools are being established everywhere,

24:25.680 --> 24:27.510
with dedicated courses in craftsmanship.

24:27.510 --> 24:28.510
A few days ago,

24:28.790 --> 24:29.680
I even came across Tang You

24:29.680 --> 24:31.340
teaching classes at a school.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.190
Oh, right,

24:32.790 --> 24:33.920
a new city has sprung up

24:33.920 --> 24:34.750
in the south

24:35.030 --> 24:35.880
called Yandu.

24:36.240 --> 24:37.960
It's where master craftsmen gather.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.030
I heard that in a while,

24:39.030 --> 24:39.750
they'll hold

24:39.750 --> 24:42.000
lectures there
on the Unparalleled Secret Magic.

24:42.000 --> 24:42.880
That's great.

24:43.110 --> 24:44.310
It means the choice we made back then

24:44.310 --> 24:44.920
was right.

24:45.350 --> 24:46.310
The Unparalleled Secret Magic

24:46.310 --> 24:48.440
is truly a scripture to save the world.

24:50.110 --> 24:50.640
However,

24:51.000 --> 24:52.590
it's been hard on the Landlady.

24:52.590 --> 24:54.240
Nowadays, nobody comes here

24:54.240 --> 24:55.480
fighting all day anymore.

24:55.480 --> 24:56.440
Doing inn business now

24:56.440 --> 24:57.590
depends on good food

24:57.880 --> 24:59.070
and attentive service.

24:59.070 --> 25:01.030
Just the other day
I even overheard them discussing

25:01.030 --> 25:03.090
whether to rename it the Fortune Inn.

25:07.240 --> 25:08.640
How have you been lately?

25:08.990 --> 25:09.910
Same as always.

25:10.440 --> 25:11.640
I was in seclusion a while ago

25:11.640 --> 25:13.440
and just came down the mountain.

25:13.750 --> 25:14.610
What about you?

25:14.680 --> 25:16.680
What are your plans from here on out?

25:17.760 --> 25:18.760
I have a friend

25:18.790 --> 25:20.720
who has asked me to
help with a tricky matter.

25:20.720 --> 25:22.000
Once I've settled things here for An,

25:22.000 --> 25:22.660
I'll leave.

25:23.440 --> 25:24.350
If it's tricky,

25:24.880 --> 25:27.080
remember not to push yourself too hard.

25:31.070 --> 25:32.590
Attendant, another jin of beef!

25:32.590 --> 25:33.520
Coming right up!

25:34.000 --> 25:34.350
Here.

25:35.510 --> 25:36.270
Are you

25:36.550 --> 25:37.950
a bit reluctant to leave?

25:39.750 --> 25:40.480
Actually...

25:41.880 --> 25:42.610
To be honest,

25:43.440 --> 25:44.270
I've been feeling

25:44.270 --> 25:45.600
very different lately.

25:46.270 --> 25:46.790
Look,

25:47.640 --> 25:48.400
can you tell

25:48.550 --> 25:49.950
what's changed about me?

25:53.180 --> 25:53.980
You...

25:55.960 --> 25:56.620
got fatter.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.930
What are you talking about?

25:59.720 --> 26:01.180
I'll let you in on a secret.

26:01.240 --> 26:03.640
Upon reaching the Great Completion Stage
with my Divine Sword,

26:03.640 --> 26:04.900
it felt as though something within me
had unlocked—

26:04.900 --> 26:06.030
my progress soared.

26:06.270 --> 26:07.030
My cultivation

26:07.030 --> 26:08.560
has been progressing by leaps and bounds.

26:08.560 --> 26:09.690
I can barely gauge

26:09.720 --> 26:11.450
what level I'm even at anymore.

26:13.680 --> 26:14.400
I mean it!

26:14.920 --> 26:15.640
I constantly feel

26:15.640 --> 26:17.200
the sword will surging inside my body.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.920
Now I don't even need to pick up my sword.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.210
The moment I close my eyes,

26:20.210 --> 26:21.210
all those moves

26:21.240 --> 26:22.200
and mental techniques

26:22.200 --> 26:23.730
appear right in front of me.

26:24.070 --> 26:26.200
It's as though all things in existence

26:26.400 --> 26:28.160
have become swords for me
to command at will.

26:28.160 --> 26:28.720
Tell me,

26:28.960 --> 26:30.750
am I about to achieve godhood
through martial arts?

26:30.750 --> 26:31.890
That impressive?

26:31.920 --> 26:33.180
It is that impressive!

26:34.750 --> 26:35.810
And another thing—

26:36.160 --> 26:37.690
lately, I keep feeling like

26:38.000 --> 26:40.310
there's heavenly lightning
about to strike me.

26:40.310 --> 26:40.960
It's gotten so bad that I don't

26:40.960 --> 26:42.790
even dare walk through open spaces.

26:42.790 --> 26:44.650
Lightning is going to strike you?

26:44.680 --> 26:45.240
Master,

26:45.720 --> 26:46.920
did you do something

26:47.070 --> 26:48.600
wicked that defies heaven?

26:48.920 --> 26:49.510
Attendant,

26:49.510 --> 26:49.960
another pot of wine!

26:49.960 --> 26:52.020
Go away. What does a kid like you know?

26:55.920 --> 26:57.830
Don't they say when mortals seek to
ascend to godhood,

26:57.830 --> 26:59.750
they must summon heavenly lightning
to temper their bodies?

26:59.750 --> 27:00.810
Could this be a sign

27:01.350 --> 27:03.010
that I'm about to become a god?

27:03.680 --> 27:05.240
Now that the heavenly ladder is broken,

27:05.240 --> 27:06.510
even if you become a god,

27:06.510 --> 27:08.040
you can't ascend to heaven.

27:08.350 --> 27:09.400
That would mean

27:09.630 --> 27:11.160
you'd be stuck in
the mortal realm forever,

27:11.160 --> 27:13.360
getting struck by lightning every day.

27:15.110 --> 27:15.590
Right,

27:15.960 --> 27:17.160
there's a letter for you.

27:17.160 --> 27:18.350
It was delivered quite some time ago

27:18.350 --> 27:19.200
and said to be from

27:19.200 --> 27:21.130
Heda Snow Mountain in North Xiang.

27:25.880 --> 27:26.640
Lu Qianqiao,

27:27.030 --> 27:27.590
Xin Mei,

27:28.200 --> 27:29.200
I've found a home.

27:30.070 --> 27:31.270
My home is beautiful.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.790
Don't worry about me.

27:33.000 --> 27:33.800
Zuo Yingying.

27:34.310 --> 27:35.440
Who sent the letter?

27:35.590 --> 27:36.390
Zuo Yingying.

27:37.000 --> 27:38.060
She's found a home.

27:45.030 --> 27:46.230
Just these few words.

27:46.480 --> 27:48.340
Is it really worth a whole letter?

27:49.000 --> 27:51.200
Why didn't she mention me in the letter?

27:51.400 --> 27:51.790
An!

27:51.790 --> 27:53.770
-To think I treated her to so many meals!
-Come on!

27:53.770 --> 27:54.310
The dishes are here!

27:54.310 --> 27:54.880
Hurry.

28:00.030 --> 28:00.630
Thank you.

28:00.830 --> 28:01.760
You're welcome.

28:06.000 --> 28:06.590
A kitty.

28:07.440 --> 28:08.370
Is this your cat?

28:08.920 --> 28:09.590
So cute.

28:10.070 --> 28:11.110
What a silly cat.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.070
So wild.

28:12.790 --> 28:13.850
Come on, let's eat.

28:13.860 --> 28:15.260
The food is getting cold.

28:18.480 --> 28:19.610
-Here.
-Attendant.

28:19.960 --> 28:20.420
Coming.

28:20.440 --> 28:21.070
Another pot of wine!

28:21.070 --> 28:21.680
Coming.

28:21.790 --> 28:22.990
Please wait a moment.

28:55.350 --> 28:56.550
A letter has arrived!

28:56.640 --> 28:57.840
A letter has arrived!

29:01.510 --> 29:02.910
There's a letter for her.

29:05.550 --> 29:07.080
Yingying, a letter for you.

29:23.270 --> 29:23.930
"Yingying,

29:24.270 --> 29:25.470
it's been a long time.

29:26.790 --> 29:28.390
As I write this letter to you,

29:28.440 --> 29:29.840
I'm at the Safe Haven Inn,

29:30.440 --> 29:31.480
having just drunk Lord of Rust-Sword's

29:31.480 --> 29:32.680
treasured fake wine.

29:34.160 --> 29:35.560
I feel a bit lightheaded,

29:35.640 --> 29:37.000
but I have an overwhelming urge

29:37.000 --> 29:38.110
to say so many, many things

29:38.110 --> 29:39.110
to you.

29:40.590 --> 29:43.390
Business at Safe Haven Inn
has gotten even better.

29:43.480 --> 29:45.400
Lin Muhan has taken over Lingji Mountain,

29:45.400 --> 29:47.640
along with the remaining disciples
of the Tianyuan Sect,

29:47.640 --> 29:50.240
becoming the new leader
of the immortal sects.

29:51.200 --> 29:52.660
He's matured a great deal.

29:53.030 --> 29:54.200
Under his leadership,

29:54.200 --> 29:56.350
the Immortal Sect Assembly
runs flawlessly.

29:56.350 --> 29:57.110
He said

29:57.640 --> 29:59.680
it doesn't matter
if the heavenly ladder is broken;

29:59.680 --> 30:01.280
he will lead all cultivators

30:01.440 --> 30:02.840
to find a new way forward.

30:04.550 --> 30:05.750
As for the Lord of Rust-Sword,

30:05.750 --> 30:07.480
things are a bit dramatic with him.

30:07.480 --> 30:09.510
He claims he's about to achieve godhood

30:09.510 --> 30:10.770
through the sword path

30:11.070 --> 30:14.470
and keeps feeling as though lightning is
about to strike him.

30:14.680 --> 30:15.480
I told him

30:15.680 --> 30:17.550
that the heavenly ladder is still broken,

30:17.550 --> 30:19.150
so if he wants to become a god,

30:19.200 --> 30:20.660
it will be a bit difficult.

30:25.880 --> 30:26.750
Also...

30:28.880 --> 30:29.640
Lu Qianqiao

30:30.480 --> 30:32.210
has forgotten everything now—

30:32.270 --> 30:34.000
he doesn't remember me either.

30:34.640 --> 30:36.000
But I will find him.

30:39.270 --> 30:39.870
By the way,

30:40.310 --> 30:41.400
I also met Jin Lun.

30:42.510 --> 30:43.790
Since cultivating the Path of Detachment,

30:43.790 --> 30:45.650
he's spoken in even more riddles.

30:46.030 --> 30:48.490
But luckily, he's always been
very patient.

30:48.960 --> 30:49.880
He told me

30:50.310 --> 30:52.240
that Sheng has already become a god

30:52.520 --> 30:53.440
and transformed into

30:53.440 --> 30:55.030
a life form called a field.

30:56.160 --> 30:57.590
Although she can't be seen

30:57.590 --> 30:58.270
or touched,

30:59.030 --> 31:00.690
she can always stay by my side.

31:02.240 --> 31:03.240
Sometimes I can feel

31:03.240 --> 31:04.240
her presence,

31:05.350 --> 31:06.750
and I feel that's enough.

31:08.480 --> 31:10.160
I've also come to understand something.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.680
The old gives way to the new;

31:11.680 --> 31:13.350
the sun rises without ceasing.

31:13.350 --> 31:14.400
Dry riverbeds

31:14.420 --> 31:16.440
will always give birth to new streams.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.310
A withered forest will one day

31:18.310 --> 31:19.770
flourish with life again.

31:20.290 --> 31:21.270
Everything seems

31:21.270 --> 31:22.310
to move in cycles,

31:22.550 --> 31:23.680
turning endlessly.

31:24.830 --> 31:26.440
And we who live in this world

31:26.920 --> 31:28.780
are here to catch one more glimpse

31:28.920 --> 31:30.380
of the sun as it rises anew.

31:32.550 --> 31:33.110
Lastly,

31:33.680 --> 31:34.550
I wish you well,

31:35.160 --> 31:36.920
and may all things go smoothly for you.

31:36.920 --> 31:37.680
Xin Mei."

31:44.480 --> 31:45.080
Yingying.

31:56.110 --> 31:59.040
Didn't you always want to teach me
how to ride a horse?

32:06.590 --> 32:08.190
You're willing to learn now?

32:47.160 --> 32:48.160
Then I'm leaving.

32:49.440 --> 32:49.960
Go on.

32:51.240 --> 32:52.040
Safe travels.

32:55.480 --> 32:56.080
Take care.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.000
Father?

35:19.360 --> 35:20.760
Greetings, Sect Master!

35:21.150 --> 35:23.800
May your might and prestige

35:23.840 --> 35:25.170
shake heaven and earth!

35:25.440 --> 35:26.880
May your might and prestige

35:26.880 --> 35:28.210
shake heaven and earth!

36:04.630 --> 36:05.070
This is

36:05.570 --> 36:06.740
Immortal Xin Mei

36:07.110 --> 36:08.170
from Xin Xie Manor.

36:08.550 --> 36:09.000
This is

36:09.360 --> 36:11.230
Lord Lu Huai.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.650
A strand of dark hair entwined—

36:14.800 --> 36:17.200
bound together in a vow
to share a lifetime.

36:19.030 --> 36:20.630
A vow to grow old side by side,

36:20.920 --> 36:22.780
a perfect union eternally bound.

36:23.150 --> 36:24.440
A perfect match—

36:25.480 --> 36:27.080
truly a union made in heaven!

36:30.480 --> 36:32.230
You knew full well you wouldn't die,

36:32.230 --> 36:33.590
so why did you marry me?

36:33.960 --> 36:35.670
To leave me carrying that burden,

36:35.670 --> 36:37.070
to fill me with resentment on your behalf.

36:37.070 --> 36:38.420
I really want to know:

36:38.630 --> 36:39.840
when I risked my life—

36:40.000 --> 36:41.200
using my meager magic

36:41.350 --> 36:42.400
to seek justice for you

36:42.400 --> 36:43.670
and avenge you—

36:44.510 --> 36:46.240
what were you really thinking?

36:48.760 --> 36:49.620
I was grateful.

36:50.360 --> 36:51.030
Miss Xin,

36:51.880 --> 36:53.340
I'm truly grateful to you.

36:54.280 --> 36:55.280
But I do have

36:55.280 --> 36:57.280
reasons I cannot share with anyone.

36:57.320 --> 36:59.120
They concern my life and safety.

36:59.400 --> 37:00.660
But please believe me,

37:01.320 --> 37:03.580
I never had any intention of harming you.

37:10.480 --> 37:12.080
Even if he's lost his memory,

37:12.220 --> 37:12.880
his nature,

37:13.510 --> 37:14.400
temperament,

37:15.000 --> 37:16.370
habits, and preferences

37:16.370 --> 37:17.170
won't change.

37:17.630 --> 37:18.150
So,

37:19.030 --> 37:20.190
I must find him.

37:57.240 --> 38:00.640
[Yuan Zhong, Youhu Clan]

37:58.040 --> 37:58.710
Yeah, you.

38:02.920 --> 38:03.980
Can I help you, sir?

38:04.670 --> 38:06.030
You scared my fish away.

38:07.330 --> 38:08.630
The current's so strong,

38:08.630 --> 38:09.510
and it just rained.

38:09.510 --> 38:11.310
How could there be any fish here?

38:11.480 --> 38:12.080
There was.

38:13.510 --> 38:14.840
I was waiting for a fish—

38:15.440 --> 38:17.400
a fish I've been waiting for a long time,

38:17.400 --> 38:19.130
finally about to take the bait.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.020
Then you walked by,

38:21.440 --> 38:22.070
and it was

38:22.710 --> 38:23.920
scared off.

38:25.920 --> 38:27.150
I still have things to do.

38:27.150 --> 38:29.150
Then what do you propose we do about it?

38:29.150 --> 38:29.880
Very simple.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.610
Just compensate me.

38:32.650 --> 38:33.840
I heard carp are going for

38:33.840 --> 38:35.300
10 mace per jin these days.

38:35.630 --> 38:37.000
Better-quality bighead carp

38:37.000 --> 38:38.660
can fetch 30 to 50 mace per jin.

38:39.670 --> 38:41.070
My fish was big and fat

38:41.480 --> 38:42.940
and of excellent quality.

38:43.150 --> 38:44.280
Multiply that by 10—

38:44.550 --> 38:45.880
call it 500 mace per jin.

38:46.590 --> 38:47.720
Altogether, you can

38:48.630 --> 38:50.030
compensate me 700 taels.

38:50.670 --> 38:51.800
Are you kidding me?

38:52.070 --> 38:53.360
Even gold and jade

38:53.360 --> 38:54.760
aren't priced like that.

38:57.190 --> 38:58.850
You don't want to pay in money?

39:01.150 --> 39:02.950
Then make it up to me another way.

39:03.030 --> 39:04.800
I waited a long time for that fish.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.550
I wouldn't say
I poured my heart and soul into it,

39:06.550 --> 39:09.150
but I had pinned all my hopes on it.

39:09.840 --> 39:11.000
And now, because you passed by,

39:11.000 --> 39:11.930
the fish ran off.

39:12.630 --> 39:14.230
All my efforts went to waste.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.760
If you can make those lost years up to me,

39:16.760 --> 39:17.920
I'll call us even.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.660
How about that?

39:20.360 --> 39:22.090
How long have you been waiting?

39:22.230 --> 39:22.800
Not long.

39:23.670 --> 39:24.510
Just 40 years.

39:26.590 --> 39:28.110
You, disciple of Xin Xie Manor,

39:28.110 --> 39:29.570
are really unreasonable.

39:30.920 --> 39:32.520
But then again, not just you—

39:32.840 --> 39:35.320
if I were the one doing
this impossible search through the masses,

39:35.320 --> 39:35.960
I wouldn't have the leisure

39:35.960 --> 39:38.220
to waste time with some stranger either.

39:38.840 --> 39:39.800
What do you mean?

39:41.030 --> 39:42.430
Searching for one person

39:43.000 --> 39:44.260
in a vast sea of people.

39:45.440 --> 39:46.920
You know I'm looking for someone?

39:46.920 --> 39:49.050
I not only know who you're looking for—

39:49.190 --> 39:49.880
I know

39:50.510 --> 39:51.190
where he is.

39:52.230 --> 39:53.000
Where is he?

40:03.670 --> 40:05.070
How much money did you say

40:05.360 --> 40:07.000
f-for that fish earlier?

40:07.550 --> 40:08.670
Seven hundred taels...

40:08.670 --> 40:10.230
I'll scrape the money together
and pay you.

40:10.230 --> 40:10.960
Will that do?

40:12.280 --> 40:13.810
That was the price just now.

40:14.110 --> 40:14.670
Now,

40:15.630 --> 40:16.430
it's changed.

40:21.200 --> 40:21.960
Then what would it take

40:21.960 --> 40:23.560
for you to tell me where he is?

40:23.670 --> 40:24.870
As long as you tell me,

40:25.030 --> 40:26.030
I'll do anything.

40:28.230 --> 40:28.840
Anything?

40:30.030 --> 40:30.710
Anything.
